ECHO
====

Print text to terminal.


BASIC
-----
echo "Hello World"

Prints: Hello World


VARIABLES
---------
echo $HOME

Prints your home directory.


CREATE FILE
-----------
echo "content" > file.txt

Creates file with content.


APPEND TO FILE
---------------
echo "more" >> file.txt

Adds content to existing file.


SPECIAL
-------
echo -n "text"       No newline at end
echo -e "a\nb"       Interpret escape codes


EXAMPLES
--------
echo "Done!"
echo "Line 1"
echo $USER
echo "User: $USER"
